= 1919 [+ pnf_full_name +] Congress

The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">Fasci Italiani di Combattimento</span>, known also as the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">Fasci</span>, was formed in March and are having their first congress to decide the party's agenda. It seems all but confirmed that Benito Mussolini will come out on top.

- @mussolini_1919: The party votes...

@mussolini_1919
face-image: img/portraits/BenitoMussolini.jpg

As expected, Benito Mussolini will continue to lead the Fasci. Surprisingly, they have also decided to participate in the latest elections, perhaps signaling a change in rhetoric.